WEBVTT

00:01.547 --> 00:02.677
<b>[non-English chants]</b>

00:02.717 --> 00:04.047
<b>[REGULUS]
Listen here.</b>

00:04.097 --> 00:06.217
<b>I'm getting sick
of your jokes,</b>

00:06.267 --> 00:09.517
<b>getting all big-headed just
cause you got a tiny bit lucky.</b>

00:09.557 --> 00:10.517
<b>How revolting!</b>

00:10.557 --> 00:11.937
<b>So despicable!</b>

00:11.977 --> 00:14.147
<b>What an absolutely
self-righteous piece of work</b>

00:14.187 --> 00:15.897
<b>you are, huh?</b>

00:15.937 --> 00:17.357
<b>Oh, please!</b>

00:17.397 --> 00:19.237
<b>When will you realize
that tearing others down</b>

00:19.277 --> 00:20.777
<b>doesn't make you any bigger?</b>

00:20.817 --> 00:22.367
<b>[PETELGEUSE]
Ah, and here I am,</b>

00:22.407 --> 00:24.737
<b>so vehemently and diligently
trying to appeal to you.</b>

00:24.777 --> 00:25.947
<b>Unbelievable!</b>

00:25.987 --> 00:28.457
<b>Just how slothful
can one man be?</b>

00:28.497 --> 00:29.707
<b>How dare you!</b>

00:29.747 --> 00:31.247
<b>You're certainly
violating my rights</b>

00:31.287 --> 00:34.087
<b>as an unselfish man who
desires one small thing,</b>

00:34.127 --> 00:37.757
<b>one who'd settle for a tiny bit
of simple, ordinary happiness.</b>

00:38.967 --> 00:41.837
<b>[eerie music]</b>

00:41.887 --> 00:49.177
<b>♪ ♪</b>

00:56.897 --> 00:57.857
<b>[EMILIA]
I love you.</b>

00:57.897 --> 01:01.447
<b>[SUBARU gasps]</b>

01:04.907 --> 01:07.407
<b>[SUBARU]
I'm inside the carriage.</b>

01:10.827 --> 01:12.667
<b>Emilia?</b>

01:12.707 --> 01:16.337
<b>I didn't return
by death, did I?</b>

01:16.377 --> 01:18.297
<b>[EMILIA groans]</b>

01:18.337 --> 01:20.627
<b>She's so soft and cozy.</b>

01:20.667 --> 01:22.127
<b>[sighs]</b>

01:22.177 --> 01:25.507
<b>[BEATRICE] Try not to get
up to too much mischief now.</b>

01:25.547 --> 01:28.927
<b>Emilia lost two nights of sleep
worrying about you, I suppose.</b>

01:28.967 --> 01:31.137
<b>Oh, thank
goodness, you're OK!</b>

01:31.177 --> 01:32.437
<b>And everyone else?</b>

01:32.477 --> 01:33.897
<b>[BEATRICE]
You can put your mind at ease.</b>

01:33.937 --> 01:36.227
<b>Everyone is safe
and together, I suppose.</b>

01:36.267 --> 01:37.857
<b>[SUBARU]
Man, that's such a huge relief!</b>

01:37.897 --> 01:39.727
<b>I was seriously freaking out.</b>

01:39.777 --> 01:41.237
<b>Let me hug you.</b>

01:42.897 --> 01:46.117
<b>[eerie music]</b>

01:46.157 --> 01:48.947
<b>♪ ♪</b>

01:48.987 --> 01:50.237
<b>Wait, is this--</b>

01:50.287 --> 01:51.537
<b>[BEATRICE]
Indeed.</b>

01:53.667 --> 01:57.167
<b>We're inside of the Pleiades
Watchtower, I suppose.</b>

01:57.207 --> 02:04.507
<b>♪ ♪</b>

02:05.337 --> 02:06.587
<b>You're the one.</b>

02:06.637 --> 02:10.347
<b>♪ ♪</b>

02:10.387 --> 02:12.307
<b>Who exactly are you?</b>

02:12.347 --> 02:13.847
<b>Are-- you the sage?</b>

02:13.887 --> 02:16.727
<b>[SHAULA]
I finally found you, my master.</b>

02:16.767 --> 02:18.017
<b>Huh?</b>

02:20.777 --> 02:22.777
<b>Master!</b>

02:22.817 --> 02:24.487
<b>Oh, man! Oh, man!</b>

02:24.527 --> 02:26.947
<b>I've been waiting forever.</b>

02:26.987 --> 02:28.027
<b>What--</b>

02:28.067 --> 02:29.277
<b>what is the meaning of this?</b>

02:29.327 --> 02:30.737
<b>It's been such a long time.</b>

02:30.787 --> 02:31.867
<b>I missed you so much!</b>

02:31.907 --> 02:33.327
<b>[SUBARU]
What's happening?</b>

02:33.367 --> 02:34.497
<b>Ow!</b>

02:34.537 --> 02:36.167
<b>What's with
this brute strength?</b>

02:36.207 --> 02:38.127
<b>I have no idea
who you even are.</b>

02:38.167 --> 02:39.377
<b>What is this?</b>

02:39.417 --> 02:40.707
<b>What do you mean
you don't know?</b>

02:40.747 --> 02:43.547
<b>I'm Shaula, keeper
of the Pleiades Watchtower!</b>

02:43.587 --> 02:47.297
<b>How can you ever forget about
your precious student Shaula?</b>

02:48.717 --> 02:49.847
<b>Oh, no!</b>

02:49.887 --> 02:52.307
<b>I woke up and Subaru
was go-- huh?</b>

02:52.347 --> 02:55.267
<b>[SUBARU groans]</b>

02:55.307 --> 02:58.057
<b>Please, Mili,
you gotta help me!</b>

02:58.097 --> 03:00.607
<b>[SUBARU groans]</b>

03:00.647 --> 03:01.817
<b>[EMILIA]
Ee!</b>

03:01.857 --> 03:03.187
<b>What? Why me?</b>

03:03.227 --> 03:04.567
<b>I'm not totally sure.</b>

03:04.607 --> 03:07.107
<b>I just feel really
upset right now.</b>

03:07.157 --> 03:08.107
<b>[squeal]</b>

03:09.197 --> 03:13.577
<b>Subaru, please do
try not to let us down.</b>

03:13.617 --> 03:15.577
<b>Your lewd face is disgusting.</b>

03:15.617 --> 03:16.787
<b>Baru-sleaze.</b>

03:16.827 --> 03:17.957
<b>There's nothing
lewd about it.</b>

03:17.997 --> 03:19.327
<b>And don't call me that!</b>

03:19.377 --> 03:22.417
<b>Master, master,
I'll never leave you again!</b>

03:22.457 --> 03:24.457
<b>Anyway, can you
all start explaining</b>

03:24.507 --> 03:25.837
<b>before my arm gets ripped off?</b>

03:25.877 --> 03:28.047
<b>Afraid we're just
as baffled as you are.</b>

03:28.087 --> 03:29.887
<b>That woman barely
said a word when we met,</b>

03:29.927 --> 03:31.637
<b>just went right over
and started clinging</b>

03:31.677 --> 03:33.847
<b>on to you like crazy.</b>

03:33.887 --> 03:35.017
<b>She was quiet?</b>

03:35.057 --> 03:36.847
<b>You said it yourself, Master.</b>

03:36.887 --> 03:38.687
<b>Doesn't matter
what anyone asks.</b>

03:38.727 --> 03:39.807
<b>Don't say more
than you need to.</b>

03:39.847 --> 03:40.807
<b>Don't talk.</b>

03:40.857 --> 03:42.017
<b>Don't tell.</b>

03:42.067 --> 03:43.517
<b>I'll just stab 'em dead, right?</b>

03:43.567 --> 03:46.397
<b>I was just doing what you
always taught me to do.</b>

03:46.437 --> 03:49.527
<b>Your master was
a pretty awful guy, huh?</b>

03:49.567 --> 03:50.947
<b>Forget that nonsense.</b>

03:50.987 --> 03:52.577
<b>You can talk to everybody.</b>

03:54.907 --> 03:55.997
<b>Oh, yeah!</b>

03:56.037 --> 03:57.247
<b>That's baller!</b>

03:57.287 --> 03:59.247
<b>My master gave me permission.</b>

03:59.287 --> 04:00.207
<b>Woo-hoo!</b>

04:00.247 --> 04:01.497
<b>[laughing]</b>

04:01.537 --> 04:03.037
<b>OK, then, you are
the legendary sage</b>

04:03.087 --> 04:04.587
<b>we've heard so
much about, right?</b>

04:06.047 --> 04:09.087
<b>Well, if it's a Shaula you're
looking for, then that's easy.</b>

04:09.127 --> 04:10.257
<b>That is me.</b>

04:10.297 --> 04:11.847
<b>Love finds a way!</b>

04:11.887 --> 04:14.637
<b>But if it's Shaula the sage
you're looking for,</b>

04:14.677 --> 04:16.467
<b>afraid I don't know
anything about him.</b>

04:16.517 --> 04:18.937
<b>When most people talk
about a famous Shaula,</b>

04:18.977 --> 04:20.977
<b>well, they mean this one.</b>

04:23.397 --> 04:25.517
<b>The holy gold coin
has the holy dragon.</b>

04:25.567 --> 04:27.277
<b>The gold's the first
master swordsman,</b>

04:27.317 --> 04:28.777
<b>and the silver, the sage.</b>

04:28.817 --> 04:30.777
<b>She doesn't resemble
this person in the slightest,</b>

04:30.817 --> 04:31.777
<b>I suppose.</b>

04:31.817 --> 04:32.867
<b>Wow!</b>

04:32.907 --> 04:34.407
<b>That looks just like master.</b>

04:34.447 --> 04:36.367
<b>[SUBARU]
Me? How?</b>

04:36.407 --> 04:38.497
<b>I don't think this person
really looks like Subaru</b>

04:38.537 --> 04:40.367
<b>either, to be honest with you.</b>

04:40.407 --> 04:43.207
<b>Oh, I don't think it looks
like Master now either.</b>

04:43.247 --> 04:44.747
<b>I'd recognize him blind.</b>

04:44.797 --> 04:46.207
<b>So it's no problemo.</b>

04:46.257 --> 04:48.457
<b>Where exactly did you
learn a phrase like that?</b>

04:48.507 --> 04:51.547
<b>How did you recognize
him, if not by his looks?</b>

04:51.587 --> 04:52.717
<b>His smell.</b>

04:52.757 --> 04:54.097
<b>The only person
in the whole world</b>

04:54.137 --> 04:56.257
<b>who gives off such
a unique, nose-burningly,</b>

04:56.307 --> 04:59.637
<b>pungent, sinister, downright
disgusting smell is Master.</b>

04:59.677 --> 05:02.477
<b>I've never felt so hurt
before in all my life.</b>

05:02.517 --> 05:04.857
<b>Seriously, do I smell that bad?</b>

05:04.897 --> 05:06.767
<b>Uh, Subaru, it's fine.</b>

05:06.817 --> 05:08.777
<b>I understand how
you're feeling.</b>

05:08.817 --> 05:10.527
<b>Later, we should
all bathe properly.</b>

05:10.567 --> 05:11.567
<b>Ah!</b>

05:11.607 --> 05:13.527
<b>You don't understand at all!</b>

05:13.567 --> 05:16.027
<b>[RAM] So you are Shaula,
but you aren't the sage.</b>

05:16.077 --> 05:17.407
<b>Hmm?</b>

05:17.447 --> 05:18.907
<b>Have you heard of
the master swordsman</b>

05:18.947 --> 05:20.327
<b>and holy dragon, then?</b>

05:20.367 --> 05:21.747
<b>[Shaula groans]</b>

05:21.787 --> 05:22.997
<b>[RAM]
Guess so.</b>

05:23.037 --> 05:24.747
<b>Of course I know
who those two are.</b>

05:24.787 --> 05:27.207
<b>Reid the stick swinger,
Volcanica the sarcastic,</b>

05:27.247 --> 05:28.587
<b>and I go way back.</b>

05:28.627 --> 05:30.707
<b>But they're doing
good these days, huh?</b>

05:30.757 --> 05:33.217
<b>Reid, at least, has
been dead for years.</b>

05:33.257 --> 05:34.427
<b>For real?</b>

05:34.467 --> 05:36.137
<b>He seemed like a guy
nobody could kill.</b>

05:36.177 --> 05:37.677
<b>What the heck
could have got him?</b>

05:37.717 --> 05:38.847
<b>His old age.</b>

05:38.887 --> 05:40.177
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

05:40.217 --> 05:42.767
<b>I guess he was
a human, so yeah.</b>

05:42.807 --> 05:44.227
<b>I'll be straightforward.</b>

05:44.267 --> 05:47.267
<b>Who exactly is this
person you call Master?</b>

05:47.317 --> 05:49.187
<b>That's a weird
question to ask.</b>

05:49.227 --> 05:50.567
<b>You guys are
traveling with him.</b>

05:50.607 --> 05:51.567
<b>Shouldn't you know?</b>

05:51.607 --> 05:52.987
<b>Unfortunately,</b>

05:53.027 --> 05:55.357
<b>since your master hit
his head on a chamber pot,</b>

05:55.407 --> 05:57.067
<b>he's had trouble
with his memory.</b>

05:57.117 --> 05:58.987
<b>Seriously, Master,
again with that?</b>

05:59.037 --> 06:00.407
<b>[SUBARU]
Again?</b>

06:00.447 --> 06:03.457
<b>All righty then, I'll make
the big announcement.</b>

06:03.497 --> 06:05.827
<b>My wonderful
master's name, yes,</b>

06:05.877 --> 06:08.127
<b>the name of the great
renowned wise man,</b>

06:08.167 --> 06:09.587
<b>the one and only
being in this world</b>

06:09.627 --> 06:11.507
<b>worthy of bearing
the title of Sage,</b>

06:11.547 --> 06:13.377
<b>no one else compares.</b>

06:13.417 --> 06:15.217
<b>[imitating drum roll]</b>

06:15.257 --> 06:16.757
<b>We don't need a drum roll.</b>

06:16.797 --> 06:18.847
<b>Da, da, da, da.</b>

06:18.887 --> 06:20.257
<b>It's Flugel.</b>

06:22.677 --> 06:24.057
<b>Huh?</b>

06:24.097 --> 06:27.977
<b>That's my splendid
master's name, Flugel.</b>

06:28.017 --> 06:30.647
<b>He's known as
Flugel the wise man.</b>

06:31.817 --> 06:33.197
<b>Hmm.</b>

06:33.237 --> 06:35.817
<b>[eerie music]</b>

06:35.857 --> 06:37.367
<b>♪ ♪</b>

06:37.407 --> 06:41.157
<b>Ain't that the name of the
guy who planted that tree?</b>

06:42.407 --> 06:44.827
<b>[calm music]</b>

06:44.867 --> 06:46.787
<b>Damn, that's scary!</b>

06:46.827 --> 06:48.417
<b>We're so high up.</b>

06:48.457 --> 06:50.547
<b>Isn't there a handrail
or something?</b>

06:50.587 --> 06:51.877
<b>Come on!</b>

06:51.917 --> 06:54.217
<b>This ride is way too
bouncy, Ms. naked lady.</b>

06:54.257 --> 06:55.467
<b>Can you smooth it out?</b>

06:55.507 --> 06:57.177
<b>A kid hitching
a free ride shouldn't</b>

06:57.217 --> 06:58.887
<b>be so demanding, you know?</b>

07:00.097 --> 07:01.847
<b>Hey, quit pulling on my hair!</b>

07:01.887 --> 07:03.597
<b>Come on, give
her a break, Meili.</b>

07:03.637 --> 07:04.807
<b>Enough pestering!</b>

07:04.847 --> 07:06.847
<b>And stop messing
with her ponytail.</b>

07:06.887 --> 07:08.267
<b>It is not a ponytail.</b>

07:08.307 --> 07:10.017
<b>It's a scorpion tail.</b>

07:10.067 --> 07:11.647
<b>A wah?</b>

07:11.687 --> 07:13.937
<b>A scorpion tail!</b>

07:13.987 --> 07:15.567
<b>Yeah, I got it.</b>

07:15.607 --> 07:18.197
<b>Why get so hung up on that?</b>

07:18.237 --> 07:19.697
<b>[SHAULA giggles]</b>

07:19.737 --> 07:21.867
<b>This door serves
as the tower's primary entrance</b>

07:21.907 --> 07:23.327
<b>and exit, I suppose.</b>

07:23.367 --> 07:25.657
<b>Rem and Patrasche are
waiting on the next floor</b>

07:25.697 --> 07:26.657
<b>above this one.</b>

07:26.707 --> 07:27.957
<b>We have to go higher?</b>

07:27.997 --> 07:29.787
<b>Also, if this is
the entrance, how</b>

07:29.827 --> 07:32.997
<b>did Patrasche and the carriage
get all the way up there?</b>

07:33.047 --> 07:35.337
<b>Shaula carried
everything there for us.</b>

07:35.377 --> 07:38.007
<b>Just hop, up they went.</b>

07:38.047 --> 07:39.087
<b>Pardon?</b>

07:39.137 --> 07:42.967
<b>Aw, that was a piece of cake.</b>

07:43.007 --> 07:46.227
<b>I'm far more freaked out than
I am grateful at the moment.</b>

07:46.267 --> 07:47.517
<b>It doesn't matter
to me whether</b>

07:47.557 --> 07:49.057
<b>you're grateful or freaked out.</b>

07:49.097 --> 07:52.607
<b>All I ask is that you accept
my earnest feelings for you.</b>

07:52.647 --> 07:53.687
<b>Nope!</b>

07:53.727 --> 07:55.147
<b>You just threw 'em away!</b>

07:58.697 --> 08:00.197
<b>[SUBARU] So I guess
Flugel was the one</b>

08:00.237 --> 08:01.947
<b>who built all of this too?</b>

08:01.987 --> 08:04.947
<b>You know, I'd heard about him
being known as the sage before,</b>

08:04.997 --> 08:07.457
<b>but I never thought I'd
hear about him again here.</b>

08:07.497 --> 08:09.077
<b>Well, I don't
really know what</b>

08:09.117 --> 08:10.957
<b>his accomplishments were
aside from planting that tree,</b>

08:10.997 --> 08:12.287
<b>I suppose.</b>

08:12.337 --> 08:14.207
<b>[SUBARU] The tower
sure is gigantic, though.</b>

08:14.247 --> 08:16.047
<b>It's finally
starting to hit me.</b>

08:16.087 --> 08:17.507
<b>[JULIUS]
What's starting to hit you?</b>

08:17.547 --> 08:19.337
<b>[SUBARU] That this is
the Pleiades Watchtower</b>

08:19.377 --> 08:21.467
<b>that we were trying
to reach all this time.</b>

08:21.507 --> 08:23.137
<b>Ah-ah-ah.</b>

08:23.177 --> 08:26.217
<b>If that's all you understand,
you get 99 out of 100 points</b>

08:26.267 --> 08:27.477
<b>at the very best.</b>

08:27.517 --> 08:28.977
<b>That's basically
a perfect score.</b>

08:29.017 --> 08:30.847
<b>Well, you've gotta
consider that the final score</b>

08:30.887 --> 08:33.397
<b>factors in bonus points
granted for how much</b>

08:33.437 --> 08:36.107
<b>I love, love, love, love you!</b>

08:36.147 --> 08:39.107
<b>Pleiades Watchtower is nothing
more than a temporary name</b>

08:39.147 --> 08:40.857
<b>for a temporary role.</b>

08:40.897 --> 08:43.237
<b>Now that you've finally
returned, that's over,</b>

08:43.277 --> 08:45.827
<b>and it'll revert back
to its original role.</b>

08:45.867 --> 08:47.327
<b>Its original role?</b>

08:47.367 --> 08:50.867
<b>Yup, a special place where
you can find everything</b>

08:50.907 --> 08:54.917
<b>you'd wanna know,
a great library.</b>

08:54.957 --> 08:57.007
<b>Oh, it's such a joyous day.</b>

08:57.047 --> 09:00.257
<b>The great Pleiades library
is so, so, so, so, so happy</b>

09:00.297 --> 09:01.887
<b>to have you back!</b>

09:01.927 --> 09:03.847
<b>[giggles]</b>

09:03.887 --> 09:06.717
<b>Rem and Patrasche
are inside of here?</b>

09:06.757 --> 09:07.847
<b>Whoa!</b>

09:07.887 --> 09:10.477
<b>Hey, Ram, a vine's just moved!</b>

09:10.517 --> 09:11.687
<b>You're too jumpy.</b>

09:11.727 --> 09:13.687
<b>You'll startle
the room's master.</b>

09:13.727 --> 09:16.817
<b>What do you mean
by its master?</b>

09:16.857 --> 09:18.147
<b>A spirit.</b>

09:21.777 --> 09:26.777
<b>♪ ♪</b>

09:26.827 --> 09:29.537
<b>This place feels
like an actual jungle.</b>

09:34.707 --> 09:38.047
<b>[bright music]</b>

09:38.087 --> 09:40.547
<b>♪ ♪</b>

09:40.587 --> 09:43.717
<b>Rem and Patrasche.</b>

09:43.757 --> 09:45.797
<b>Back when we
rejoined Ms. Emilia,</b>

09:45.847 --> 09:48.757
<b>Patrasche was
unfortunately gravely injured.</b>

09:48.807 --> 09:52.307
<b>But the spirit's power
has been healing her.</b>

09:52.347 --> 09:53.977
<b>The spirit living
here doesn't seem</b>

09:54.017 --> 09:56.147
<b>to have anything like a will.</b>

09:56.187 --> 09:59.227
<b>It just attempts to heal
the illnesses and injuries</b>

09:59.277 --> 10:00.487
<b>of creatures who enter.</b>

10:00.527 --> 10:03.107
<b>Does that mean
it could heal Rem?</b>

10:03.147 --> 10:04.737
<b>[RAM]
That's beyond its power.</b>

10:04.777 --> 10:08.237
<b>It can't heal something that
isn't an illness or injury.</b>

10:08.277 --> 10:09.657
<b>This is neither.</b>

10:11.157 --> 10:14.247
<b>So in other words, even after
coming here, nothing's changed.</b>

10:14.287 --> 10:15.877
<b>[RAM]
If you want to change it,</b>

10:15.917 --> 10:19.247
<b>don't forget what you came
here to do in the first place.</b>

10:19.297 --> 10:21.587
<b>The great Pleiades library.</b>

10:21.627 --> 10:23.167
<b>[sighs]</b>

10:24.967 --> 10:26.797
<b>I'm going to find
the answer we're looking for</b>

10:26.837 --> 10:28.047
<b>and get Rem back.</b>

10:28.097 --> 10:30.217
<b>That goal hasn't
changed, not one bit.</b>

10:30.257 --> 10:33.637
<b>Right, I'm gonna
rejoin the others.</b>

10:33.677 --> 10:35.137
<b>You with me?</b>

10:35.187 --> 10:37.607
<b>[RAM] Leaving Rem here
with no one watching her?</b>

10:37.647 --> 10:39.817
<b>Doesn't that worry you?</b>

10:39.857 --> 10:42.687
<b>All right, I'll leave you
in charge of keeping her safe.</b>

10:42.737 --> 10:45.107
<b>[RAM] I suppose
that's all I can do for her.</b>

10:46.317 --> 10:47.737
<b>[SUBARU]
You staying by her side</b>

10:47.777 --> 10:49.577
<b>and watching over her
means more than you think.</b>

10:49.617 --> 10:56.917
<b>♪ ♪</b>

11:00.747 --> 11:04.087
<b>Rem and Patrasche
both are in your hands.</b>

11:07.637 --> 11:10.597
<b>This entire floor is
basically my little lady cave.</b>

11:10.637 --> 11:12.217
<b>I spend most
of my time watching</b>

11:12.257 --> 11:13.717
<b>over the dunes from here.</b>

11:13.767 --> 11:15.887
<b>And if I see anyone get
too close to the tower,</b>

11:15.927 --> 11:17.267
<b>they get shotty, shot, shot.</b>

11:17.307 --> 11:18.227
<b>[SUBARU]
I knew it.</b>

11:18.267 --> 11:19.307
<b>[ALL]
Huh?</b>

11:19.357 --> 11:20.937
<b>Of course that was you.</b>

11:20.977 --> 11:23.607
<b>You have no idea what hell
I went through because of that.</b>

11:23.647 --> 11:26.817
<b>A shot that keeps interfering
pests away from the tower,</b>

11:26.857 --> 11:29.567
<b>that's my Hell Snipe.</b>

11:29.617 --> 11:31.237
<b>So was everything fine?</b>

11:31.277 --> 11:32.617
<b>Yeah, they're safe.</b>

11:32.657 --> 11:34.327
<b>Ram's watching over them.</b>

11:36.617 --> 11:39.207
<b>We don't know how she might
react if she finds out you're</b>

11:39.247 --> 11:40.997
<b>not really Flugel, you know?</b>

11:41.037 --> 11:43.667
<b>So we can't correct
her or let her know, huh?</b>

11:43.707 --> 11:46.757
<b>Regulus and Petelgeuse were
so much easier to deal with.</b>

11:46.797 --> 11:49.217
<b>[SHAULA] Master,
is something wrong?</b>

11:49.257 --> 11:51.297
<b>No, everything's peachy.</b>

11:51.347 --> 11:53.967
<b>I just want to make sure
of something real quick.</b>

11:54.007 --> 11:55.847
<b>The reason you were
always shooting at people</b>

11:55.887 --> 11:57.137
<b>approaching the tower?</b>

11:57.177 --> 11:59.977
<b>That's right,
per your orders, Master.</b>

12:00.017 --> 12:03.397
<b>For 400 years, I spent
every day just watching</b>

12:03.437 --> 12:05.107
<b>the endless sea of sand.</b>

12:05.147 --> 12:08.107
<b>A story so terribly sad,
both hearing it and telling it</b>

12:08.147 --> 12:09.907
<b>makes me want to cry.</b>

12:09.947 --> 12:12.827
<b>400 years you were all alone?</b>

12:14.617 --> 12:17.747
<b>[SUBARU] You'll do anything
if I ask you to do it, right?</b>

12:17.787 --> 12:18.957
<b>What the heck?</b>

12:18.997 --> 12:20.327
<b>Why so serious?</b>

12:20.377 --> 12:22.247
<b>Just so you know,
I won't do anything perverted.</b>

12:22.287 --> 12:23.497
<b>[SUBARU]
No matter what,</b>

12:23.537 --> 12:25.917
<b>don't ever try
to harm me or my friends.</b>

12:27.507 --> 12:29.877
<b>Your master's standing
orders were to attack anyone</b>

12:29.927 --> 12:32.007
<b>approaching the tower, right?</b>

12:32.047 --> 12:33.677
<b>But now,
all of us are inside it,</b>

12:33.717 --> 12:36.097
<b>so there wouldn't be
any reason to attack us.</b>

12:36.137 --> 12:39.057
<b>Do not harm us
in any way, no matter what.</b>

12:41.937 --> 12:45.517
<b>OK, sir, your new orders
have been received, my master.</b>

12:45.567 --> 12:47.397
<b>I've committed
them to my memory.</b>

12:47.437 --> 12:48.437
<b>Good.</b>

12:48.487 --> 12:49.697
<b>That's a promise, then.</b>

12:49.737 --> 12:50.697
<b>Oh, yeah.</b>

12:50.737 --> 12:51.697
<b>Roger that!</b>

12:51.737 --> 12:53.067
<b>I'll protect you all.</b>

12:53.117 --> 12:55.407
<b>I'll protect the hell outta ya.</b>

12:55.447 --> 12:57.447
<b>[giggles]</b>

12:57.497 --> 12:58.657
<b>One more time then,</b>

12:58.707 --> 13:00.617
<b>it's good to have
you back, Master.</b>

13:00.657 --> 13:02.667
<b>Flugel the wise man, welcome.</b>

13:02.707 --> 13:06.417
<b>I, Shaula, have waited most
eagerly for your return.</b>

13:06.457 --> 13:07.957
<b>[giggles]</b>

13:12.297 --> 13:15.507
<b>We've passed through the sixth,
fifth, and fourth floors now.</b>

13:15.547 --> 13:18.387
<b>Above here is the exam site,
which occupies the third,</b>

13:18.427 --> 13:19.807
<b>second, and first levels.</b>

13:19.847 --> 13:20.887
<b>Hold on, exam?</b>

13:20.927 --> 13:21.887
<b>[SHAULA]
Yeppers.</b>

13:21.937 --> 13:23.267
<b>First, on the third floor,</b>

13:23.307 --> 13:24.687
<b>you'll be tested
to make sure you qualify</b>

13:24.727 --> 13:26.227
<b>to enter the archive.</b>

13:26.267 --> 13:28.067
<b>So you're saying I have
to earn the right to even</b>

13:28.107 --> 13:29.317
<b>step foot in the place.</b>

13:29.357 --> 13:30.897
<b>[JULIUS]
You're the last one,</b>

13:30.937 --> 13:33.317
<b>so this is the greatest
challenge we face at present.</b>

13:33.357 --> 13:34.697
<b>[SUBARU]
I see.</b>

13:34.737 --> 13:36.827
<b>So the rest of you already
attempted that exam</b>

13:36.867 --> 13:38.327
<b>while I was passed out.</b>

13:38.367 --> 13:41.707
<b>[eerie music]</b>

13:41.747 --> 13:46.167
<b>♪ ♪</b>

13:46.207 --> 13:49.757
<b>This looks like a room I
wouldn't wanna be stuck in.</b>

13:49.797 --> 13:51.007
<b>I agree.</b>

13:51.047 --> 13:52.507
<b>Staying here for long
would rob you</b>

13:52.547 --> 13:54.047
<b>of your sense of equilibrium.</b>

13:54.087 --> 13:57.427
<b>[calm music]</b>

13:57.467 --> 13:58.927
<b>♪ ♪</b>

13:58.967 --> 14:02.557
<b>[SUBARU grunts]</b>

14:03.267 --> 14:05.397
<b>[SUBARU]
A stone slab?</b>

14:05.437 --> 14:07.017
<b>Simply put,
you can think of this</b>

14:07.057 --> 14:08.477
<b>as the device that
sets up the puzzle</b>

14:08.517 --> 14:10.107
<b>you'll be expected to solve.</b>

14:10.147 --> 14:12.277
<b>The moment you reach
out and touch that slab,</b>

14:12.317 --> 14:15.157
<b>the exam will begin,
I suppose.</b>

14:15.197 --> 14:18.197
<b>All I need to do is
touch this monolith, then?</b>

14:18.237 --> 14:19.787
<b>Monolith, huh?</b>

14:19.827 --> 14:22.207
<b>Somehow, that name
seems rather fitting.</b>

14:22.247 --> 14:23.827
<b>I'll use it too.</b>

14:23.867 --> 14:24.787
<b>Here I go.</b>

14:24.827 --> 14:32.127
<b>♪ ♪</b>

14:44.307 --> 14:47.017
<b>[MONOLITH] Hero long
vanquished by Shaula,</b>

14:47.057 --> 14:50.857
<b>go and touch upon
his grandest splendor.</b>

14:50.897 --> 14:52.987
<b>So what do you think?</b>

14:53.027 --> 14:55.737
<b>Do you understand
our reactions now,</b>

14:55.777 --> 14:58.487
<b>why we were
so surprised at first?</b>

15:01.617 --> 15:04.907
<b>So what I heard just now
was one of the exam questions?</b>

15:04.957 --> 15:07.167
<b>Subaru, there are a few
things you must know</b>

15:07.207 --> 15:08.787
<b>before beginning the exam.</b>

15:08.837 --> 15:11.917
<b>To begin with, you should
try touching the stone slab--</b>

15:11.957 --> 15:14.297
<b>or monolith nearest to you.</b>

15:14.337 --> 15:16.427
<b>You really like
the word that much?</b>

15:16.467 --> 15:18.007
<b>I mean, it's fine, but.</b>

15:18.047 --> 15:21.257
<b>[eerie music]</b>

15:21.297 --> 15:25.017
<b>♪ ♪</b>

15:25.057 --> 15:27.387
<b>That returned you
to the starting point,</b>

15:27.437 --> 15:31.147
<b>meaning it was determined
that you failed the exam.</b>

15:31.187 --> 15:32.397
<b>Naturally.</b>

15:32.437 --> 15:38.907
<b>♪ ♪</b>

15:38.947 --> 15:41.617
<b>[MONOLITH] Hero long
vanquished by Shaula,</b>

15:41.657 --> 15:45.117
<b>go and touch upon
his grandest splendor.</b>

15:45.157 --> 15:46.617
<b>So that's how it works.</b>

15:46.657 --> 15:49.537
<b>I can keep trying over
and over until I pass it.</b>

15:49.577 --> 15:52.797
<b>That is, based on experience,
our conjecture at present.</b>

15:52.837 --> 15:55.467
<b>Just running around aimlessly
and touching monoliths blindly</b>

15:55.507 --> 15:57.587
<b>will not lead you
to the correct answer.</b>

15:57.627 --> 15:59.507
<b>That's all the advice
I can give.</b>

15:59.547 --> 16:02.507
<b>So you guys already tried
the scattershot approach.</b>

16:03.757 --> 16:05.097
<b>I'm not gonna lie,</b>

16:05.137 --> 16:07.137
<b>that does seem like
something you'd try, Mili.</b>

16:07.177 --> 16:08.477
<b>[ANASTASIA]
That's part of it.</b>

16:08.517 --> 16:10.767
<b>But even if you did
figure out the answer,</b>

16:10.807 --> 16:13.607
<b>you would still have to touch
upon his greatest splendor.</b>

16:13.647 --> 16:15.777
<b>And we don't know
what that means.</b>

16:15.817 --> 16:17.187
<b>On god.</b>

16:17.237 --> 16:18.987
<b>Either way, you won't
get anywhere standing here</b>

16:19.027 --> 16:20.867
<b>thinking about it forever.</b>

16:20.907 --> 16:24.527
<b>I think your best bet is to try
asking the naked lady about it.</b>

16:24.577 --> 16:26.367
<b>Yeah, guess so.</b>

16:26.407 --> 16:28.287
<b>Shaula, can you
think of any heroes</b>

16:28.327 --> 16:30.327
<b>you've vanquished
before who fit the bill?</b>

16:30.367 --> 16:31.997
<b>Only lame-o
second rates would</b>

16:32.037 --> 16:34.587
<b>remember the names of every
single person they vanquished.</b>

16:34.627 --> 16:37.087
<b>See, one as first rate
as me doesn't remember</b>

16:37.127 --> 16:38.257
<b>anyone beyond the first 100.</b>

16:38.297 --> 16:39.217
<b>Got it?</b>

16:39.257 --> 16:40.637
<b>Yeah, right.</b>

16:40.677 --> 16:43.927
<b>So, anyway, out of all
the names I can remember,</b>

16:43.967 --> 16:45.217
<b>let's see.</b>

16:45.257 --> 16:46.427
<b>Oh, what about Reid?</b>

16:46.467 --> 16:47.807
<b>You were the one
who killed the first</b>

16:47.847 --> 16:49.427
<b>master swordsman,
weren't you?</b>

16:49.477 --> 16:51.227
<b>[Meili screams]</b>

16:51.267 --> 16:52.727
<b>Hey, watch it!</b>

16:54.817 --> 16:56.987
<b>Thank you for the catch.</b>

16:57.017 --> 17:00.777
<b>Nah, it's kind of my fault
for blurting it out like that.</b>

17:00.817 --> 17:03.987
<b>What, does the first master
swordsman scare you that much?</b>

17:04.027 --> 17:06.117
<b>[SHAULA screams]</b>

17:06.157 --> 17:07.787
<b>[JULIUS]
Don't be silly.</b>

17:07.827 --> 17:10.117
<b>He was the progenitor
of the Astrea family,</b>

17:10.157 --> 17:11.247
<b>whom I know well.</b>

17:11.287 --> 17:12.787
<b>In addition
to his sword skills,</b>

17:12.827 --> 17:14.957
<b>he was surely a man
of great character.</b>

17:14.997 --> 17:17.377
<b>Ms. Shaula, allow us
to hear your thoughts</b>

17:17.417 --> 17:19.087
<b>without reservation.</b>

17:19.127 --> 17:21.627
<b>He was human scum,
simple as that.</b>

17:24.137 --> 17:26.557
<b>Allow us to hear your
thoughts without reservation.</b>

17:26.597 --> 17:28.427
<b>Don't pretend
you didn't hear that.</b>

17:28.467 --> 17:31.137
<b>Well, at any rate,
he was an awful guy,</b>

17:31.177 --> 17:32.977
<b>one of those
privileged little brats</b>

17:33.017 --> 17:34.647
<b>who grew up but never changed.</b>

17:34.687 --> 17:37.567
<b>He absolutely loved bullying
the weak in his spare time.</b>

17:37.607 --> 17:39.357
<b>I mean, hell,
from his perspective,</b>

17:39.397 --> 17:40.987
<b>pretty much everyone
was a weakling,</b>

17:41.027 --> 17:42.567
<b>so they were all fair game.</b>

17:42.607 --> 17:44.067
<b>No matter who he
went up against,</b>

17:44.107 --> 17:45.577
<b>he was bullying the weak.</b>

17:45.617 --> 17:47.447
<b>He did it to me all the time.</b>

17:47.487 --> 17:49.157
<b>Must have been
a real monster if he was</b>

17:49.197 --> 17:51.117
<b>able to get a one-up on you.</b>

17:51.157 --> 17:52.327
<b>Actually, wait.</b>

17:52.367 --> 17:53.957
<b>There's still a chance
that challengers</b>

17:53.997 --> 17:56.537
<b>might have to defeat Shaula
in order to enter the tower.</b>

17:56.587 --> 17:58.207
<b>And if that's the case,
the answer would have</b>

17:58.247 --> 18:01.457
<b>to be something I'd know
without having to ask her.</b>

18:01.507 --> 18:02.667
<b>Subaru?</b>

18:02.717 --> 18:05.547
<b>Natsuki, did you
think of something?</b>

18:05.597 --> 18:07.297
<b>The possibility
of conquering the tower</b>

18:07.347 --> 18:09.017
<b>without Shaula's help,</b>

18:09.057 --> 18:11.677
<b>what if there's another Shaula
that she doesn't realize</b>

18:11.727 --> 18:14.687
<b>is actually the true Shaula?</b>

18:14.727 --> 18:16.937
<b>Master, what's
up with that look?</b>

18:16.977 --> 18:19.437
<b>If he keeps staring at me like
that, I'm gonna start blushing.</b>

18:19.477 --> 18:20.437
<b>[giggles]</b>

18:20.477 --> 18:23.527
<b>[calm music]</b>

18:23.567 --> 18:28.027
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:28.077 --> 18:29.077
<b>[SUBARU]
Beako.</b>

18:29.117 --> 18:30.367
<b>Huh?</b>

18:31.287 --> 18:32.867
<b>Now, there it is.</b>

18:32.907 --> 18:36.117
<b>That's the expression that
he most enjoys seeing on you.</b>

18:36.167 --> 18:38.087
<b>I want to jump
high above here,</b>

18:38.127 --> 18:40.667
<b>look at these monoliths
with a bird's-eye view.</b>

18:43.297 --> 18:44.377
<b>[BEATRICE]
Ah!</b>

18:44.417 --> 18:47.757
<b>[inspiring music]</b>

18:47.797 --> 18:50.217
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:50.257 --> 18:51.887
<b>Looks like
my hunch was right.</b>

18:51.927 --> 18:53.637
<b>You achieved
your goal, I suppose?</b>

18:53.677 --> 18:55.517
<b>Sure did!</b>

18:55.557 --> 18:57.017
<b>How about that?</b>

18:57.057 --> 18:59.897
<b>This place is seriously
as sadistic as it could be.</b>

18:59.937 --> 19:04.277
<b>♪ ♪</b>

19:04.317 --> 19:06.197
<b>I know the hero's name.</b>

19:06.237 --> 19:07.737
<b>I'm sure of it.</b>

19:07.777 --> 19:08.777
<b>A WHITE SKY ASTERISM</b>

19:08.827 --> 19:12.077
<b>[theme music]</b>

19:12.117 --> 19:15.497
<b>[singing in English
and Japanese]</b>

19:15.537 --> 19:22.837
<b>♪ ♪</b>

20:40.497 --> 20:42.377
<b>[ANASTASIA] Natsuki,
how did you manage</b>

20:42.417 --> 20:43.627
<b>to figure out the answer?</b>

20:43.667 --> 20:45.997
<b>It's not as big a deal
as you guys think.</b>

20:46.047 --> 20:47.297
<b>But don't beat yourselves up.</b>

20:47.337 --> 20:48.917
<b>It's not your fault
you couldn't.</b>

20:48.967 --> 20:50.887
<b>In fact, there are very few
people in this entire world</b>

20:50.927 --> 20:52.637
<b>who could.</b>

20:52.677 --> 20:56.597
<b>The name of the hero vanquished
by Shaula, without a doubt,</b>

20:56.637 --> 20:58.097
<b>is Orion.</b>

20:58.137 --> 20:59.387
<b>Orion?</b>

21:00.307 --> 21:01.807
<b>Ah!</b>

21:01.847 --> 21:04.187
<b>Wait, wait, wait, I've never
heard of any Orion before!</b>

21:04.227 --> 21:05.857
<b>And I wouldn't expect you to,</b>

21:05.897 --> 21:08.437
<b>considering that
the Shaula in question</b>

21:08.477 --> 21:10.357
<b>wasn't even you to begin with.</b>

21:10.397 --> 21:12.737
<b>But the only Shaula
there is is me.</b>

21:12.777 --> 21:14.527
<b>You gave me that name, Master.</b>

21:14.577 --> 21:17.117
<b>I'm saying your master didn't
just pick a name out of a hat.</b>

21:17.157 --> 21:19.657
<b>There's an entire story
behind him choosing it.</b>

21:19.697 --> 21:21.997
<b>The story that's
behind Shaula's name,</b>

21:22.037 --> 21:25.127
<b>is it also something
only you know, Subaru?</b>

21:25.167 --> 21:27.627
<b>Well, I'm not
the only one that knows.</b>

21:27.667 --> 21:29.087
<b>It's just that
where I come from,</b>

21:29.127 --> 21:31.127
<b>there's a star named Shaula--</b>

21:31.167 --> 21:32.887
<b>the meaning
of the name Stinger.</b>

21:32.927 --> 21:36.257
<b>But more specifically,
it refers to a scorpion's tail.</b>

21:36.297 --> 21:38.057
<b>[ANASTASIA]
A scorpion?</b>

21:38.097 --> 21:39.677
<b>The legends say,</b>

21:39.717 --> 21:42.597
<b>when the hero Orion let
his ego blow up out of control,</b>

21:42.637 --> 21:44.437
<b>he was stung
and killed by a scorpion</b>

21:44.477 --> 21:47.357
<b>that was sent to torment
him and became stars.</b>

21:47.397 --> 21:48.897
<b>Then, for its achievement,</b>

21:48.937 --> 21:51.487
<b>the scorpion was also
turned into its own star.</b>

21:51.527 --> 21:54.067
<b>They say that Orion is still
terrified of that scorpion,</b>

21:54.117 --> 21:56.407
<b>even now, up in the night sky.</b>

21:56.447 --> 21:58.287
<b>When you simplify
it to that extent,</b>

21:58.327 --> 22:00.997
<b>even a hero's tale sounds
incredibly disappointing.</b>

22:01.037 --> 22:02.577
<b>So anyway,</b>

22:02.617 --> 22:05.287
<b>groups of stars that resemble
certain people or animals</b>

22:05.327 --> 22:07.087
<b>are known as constellations.</b>

22:07.127 --> 22:10.337
<b>They can sometimes
be called asterisms too.</b>

22:10.377 --> 22:14.257
<b>And when I looked down
at the monoliths from above,</b>

22:14.297 --> 22:16.097
<b>I saw them.</b>

22:16.137 --> 22:18.467
<b>I envisioned them
as the constellations</b>

22:18.507 --> 22:21.177
<b>and located Orion among them.</b>

22:21.217 --> 22:23.017
<b>[JULIUS]
What did you learn?</b>

22:23.057 --> 22:25.097
<b>[SUBARU] I gotta admit,
"his grandest splendor"</b>

22:25.147 --> 22:27.477
<b>sure was a tricky way
to phrase the question.</b>

22:27.517 --> 22:30.277
<b>The thing is, different stars
shine in different ways.</b>

22:30.317 --> 22:31.937
<b>Some are consistently bright,</b>

22:31.987 --> 22:35.027
<b>while others only
flash brighter at times.</b>

22:35.067 --> 22:37.407
<b>There are two stars
in the Orion constellation</b>

22:37.447 --> 22:39.697
<b>that could be said
to shine the brightest.</b>

22:39.737 --> 22:41.947
<b>There's Rigel, which
shines consistently brightly,</b>

22:41.997 --> 22:43.327
<b>and Betelgeuse,</b>

22:43.367 --> 22:46.457
<b>a variable star that
glows extra bright at times.</b>

22:48.037 --> 22:49.167
<b>Having two right answers?</b>

22:49.207 --> 22:50.627
<b>No way!</b>

22:50.667 --> 22:52.837
<b>I don't think a place like
this would be so sloppy.</b>

22:52.877 --> 22:55.177
<b>[calm music]</b>

22:55.217 --> 22:58.547
<b>If it were me, I think
I'd have to go with Rigel.</b>

23:01.597 --> 23:03.637
<b>[bright music]</b>

23:03.677 --> 23:09.977
<b>♪ ♪</b>

23:10.017 --> 23:12.027
<b>[groaning]</b>

23:12.067 --> 23:19.367
<b>♪ ♪</b>

23:22.617 --> 23:24.617
<b>[triumphant music]</b>

23:24.657 --> 23:26.367
<b>♪ ♪</b>
